 matches=[u['project'] for u in upstream if read('match/'+u['project']+'.json')['exact']];c=build['commons-collections'];cs=sizes['commons-collections'];probes=verify['release_tags']
 lines+=['','Facts (same rendering invocation and underlying commands above):','',f"- Exact normalized first-parent source matches: {len(matches)} — {', '.join(matches)}.",f"- Commons-collections executes {c['counts']['tests']} tests versus {cs['tests']['Test']} @Test annotations ({c['counts']['tests']/cs['tests']['Test']:.2f}×); both runs pass.",'- The Maven builds and repeated developer tests pass for commons-codec, commons-collections, Gson and ruler on the installed JDK. JDOM has no upstream root POM and requires an Ant-specific setup.',f"- Datafaker v1.9.0 differs in {probes['datafaker'][0]['difference_counts']['differing']} source file and JDOM-2.0.6 in {probes['jdom2'][0]['difference_counts']['differing']} relocated source files; both tags are off the default first-parent line, so those anchors would require a different traversal definition.",'- The index rebuild stops at invoke-pattern graph reachability; independent Lucene identifiers match. DatasetPrepare reproduces existing commons-cli entries after line-ending normalization and adds another method successfully.']
