 h += ['','Retained ignored scratch artifacts (directory entries include their full generated contents):','','- scratch/upstream/<project>/: full-history clones for all surveyed projects; scratch/clone-<project>-<attempt>.log: clone logs.','- scratch/at-t/<project>/: clean upstream exports used for syntax counts.','- scratch/build/<project>/: clean exports plus Maven outputs and Surefire XML for the required build projects.','- scratch/python/: locally installed tree-sitter and tree-sitter-java packages, pinned in the size report.','- scratch/extract-check/projects/commons-cli/: fresh upstream export plus copied libs/, dependencies.txt and src/test-original/.','- scratch/extract-check/commons-cli: relative symlink for DatasetPrepare path compatibility.','- scratch/extract-check/dataset_meta.json and dataset_info.json: final enlarged commons-cli population.','- scratch/extract-check/project_index/{json,codegraph,lucene}/: generated index artifacts; invoke output is absent due to the recorded failure.','','## Validation','','`python3 docker/stage0_verify.py` independently recomputes chosen source comparisons using git archive, probes release tags, checks history partitions and parser errors, and checks the protected tracked diff. `git diff --check` verifies whitespace. Successful developer suites were run again with the same counts and no failures. The final survey and artifact manifest are rendered by `python3 docker/stage0_handover.py`.']
 handover.write_text('\n'.join(h)+'\n')
